--------------------------------------------
This repository contains no raw sequencing data. The derived tables are
computed from publicly deposited GEO and ENCODE datasets, which remain under
their own terms and should be cited directly. Every accession used is listed
with its live verification status in audit/accession_log_merged.csv.

data/GSE254358/ holds three NCBI HTTP 404 error pages, retained as provenance
evidence. They are NCBI server output, not authored content.
